It’s easy to manage curly hair, only if you use the products which actually works and not the one’s who just make false claims. 

@moxiebeautyofficial kinda worked well for me, just letting you know.

#haircare #curlyhair #hairroutine #hairstyles

@kaybykatrina launched Kay Beauty Hydra Luscious Lip Gloss Stain and its officially making its way into my makeup routine 🙌🏻✨

I’m obsessed with how lightweight and hydrating the gloss feels, while the long-lasting stain stays smooth and even on the lips. It literally glides on like butter! 💕

And honestly, imagine having all the oily food this festive season but still keeping your lip colour intact. 😌✨ Festive-ready, always!

Comment below for the link 🔗

@katrinakaif

